# 统一 LF 行尾 —— 根治 Windows core.autocrlf 导致的 CRLF 漂移
# 所有文本文件以 LF 入库/检出（覆盖 autocrlf），docs front matter 解析不再被 CRLF 破坏。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制与不可安全转换类型：禁止换行规范化
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.wof binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.db binary
*.p12 binary
*.pfx binary